2|//!
3|//! Host root in the bridge's own user and PID namespaces may `Bind(session_id)`
4|//! for the host FUSE mounts. Guests instead call `BindCurrentContainer()` with
5|//! no identity input. Their kernel peer PID must belong to exactly one running,
6|//! committed identity container. Every operation revalidates that native
7|//! instance UUID, init process, peer process, namespaces and current principal.
8|//! No credential is copied into a guest, and UID alone never selects identity.
9|
